        `}else if(e==="image"||e==="stamp"||e==="note"){const ae=[{name:"APPROVED",cls:"approved"},{name:"CONFIDENTIAL",cls:"confidential"},{name:"DRAFT",cls:"draft"},{name:"PAID",cls:"paid"},{name:"FINAL",cls:"final"},{name:"VOID",cls:"void"}];p=`
